1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,400
I thought

2
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,780
if I just endured everything in silence,

3
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,880
it would all be over.

4
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,040
I thought

5
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:25,120
if I helped Song Yanfei
finish the dance drama,

6
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,760
it would all be worth it.

7
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,960
But I was too naive.

8
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,440
In the eyes of those rich people,

9
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,280
I'm just an innocent kid.

10
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,200
No,

11
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,640
I'm just a fool.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,000
They can play me for a fool

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,640
however they want.

14
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,160
Can I leave now?

15
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,520
Of course you can.

16
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,040
I hope you keep your word,

17
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,720
Mr. Feng.

18
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,520
Shen Xi,

19
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:12,880
are you really stupid

20
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,840
or just too naive?

21
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,840
What do you mean?

22
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:23,760
Shen Xi, you can't be like this.

23
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:26,720
You'll easily get scammed wherever you go.

24
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:29,160
No wonder you drifted in Beijing for years

25
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,420
and achieved nothing.

26
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,160
Fine.

27
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,900
Where's your brother?

28
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,240
I'll teach you a lesson today.

29
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,240
Cut the crap.

30
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,039
What do you mean?

31
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,360
Look at you,

32
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,810
getting anxious again.

33
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,720
Does being anxious help?

34
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,979
Actually, it's nothing much,

35
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,720
but there's one thing

36
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,640
you haven't figured out.

37
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:54,800
I'm

38
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,759
just a messenger.

39
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,640
The one who really
decides the championship

40
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,840
and the prize money

41
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,440
is our boss,

42
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Gao Yuhai.

43
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,690
What did you say?

44
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,000
I asked you,

45
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,000
what did you say?

46
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,400
Nothing much.

47
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,520
You were willing to sleep with me.

48
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,320
So I just

49
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:23,380
went with the flow and slept with you.

50
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:26,040
And tested you out for our boss
while I was at it.

51
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,680
You did pretty well.

52
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:34,240
You'll be in our boss's bed
in a couple of days.

53
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,410
Just be a little more flexible.

54
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,400
Oh, right.

55
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,840
Don't be too forward.

56
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:43,480
Our boss

57
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:46,170
doesn't like girls who are too flirty.

58
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,920
Is there any need to play
the innocent girl with me?

59
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,520
There's a saying,

60
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,960
one wrong step

61
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,480
leads to another.

62
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,640
I know I'm already in too deep

63
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,720
and there's no turning back.

64
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,000
So I thought,

65
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,720
I'd just bear

66
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,180
all the misfortune alone.

67
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:44,040
Since it had come to this,

68
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,760
I might as well

69
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,980
win the championship and the prize money

70
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,520
to help Song Yanfei
finish his dance drama.

71
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,320
Three days later,

72
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,520
Feng Shu took me to a place.

73
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,840
I remember

74
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,640
it was a Saturday.

75
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,400
It had already started raining at dusk.

76
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:08,520
By nightfall,

77
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,980
there was lightning and thunder.

78
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,000
It was terrifying.

79
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,560
We're here.

80
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:20,720
Let's go.

81
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:34,920
Let's go.

82
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,440
Where are we?

83
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,159
Why do you care?

84
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,440
All you need to know is that

85
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:44,400
after tonight,

86
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,240
you'll get everything you want.

87
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,480
Maybe even more.

88
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:50,090
As long as you show our boss a good time.

89
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,440
Let's go.

90
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,480
What are you waiting for?

91
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,440
Hurry up.

92
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,280
Go.

93
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,720
Hurry.

94
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,140
The boss thinks highly of you.

95
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,810
Let's go to the wine cellar.

96
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,690
The wine cellar?

97
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,240
Don't worry.

98
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,440
It's a nice place.

99
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:19,400
Let's go.

100
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,360
Let's go.

101
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,040
Come in.

102
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,400
Follow the red carpet
all the way to the end.

103
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:49,690
The boss is waiting for you inside.

104
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,280
Let's go.

105
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,320
Mr. Gao,

106
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,160
Come in.

107
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,160
Mr. Gao,

108
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,120
Stop right there.

109
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,120
Turn around.

110
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,400
Look at me.

111
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,560
Mr. Gao,

112
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,200
Come here.

113
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,800
Take a good look.

114
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:37,080
Mr. Gao,

115
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,320
Is this okay?

116
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,120
Kneel.

117
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,400
Kowtow.

118
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,240
Mr. Gao,

119
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:13,840
I...

120
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,520
I know.

121
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:26,010
You need money urgently right now.

122
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,040
Just do as I say,

123
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:32,700
and the dance competition
prize money is yours.

124
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:33,640
And this money

125
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,160
will be yours too.

126
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,560
Okay.

127
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,320
I'll kowtow.

128
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,040
Wait a minute.

129
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,400
First, say

130
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:51,720
you are willing to serve me in her place.

131
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,520
I am willing.

132
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,560
To serve Mr. Gao in your place.

133
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,920
Kowtow.

134
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:17,000
Now say

135
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:21,330
you are willing to always
respect her as the lawful wife.

136
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,080
I am willing.

137
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,500
To always respect you as the lawful wife.

138
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:31,400
Kowtow.

139
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,560
Say you are willing to be
Gao Yuhai's mistress.

140
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,360
I am willing to be
Gao Yuhai's mistress forever.

141
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,160
Louder.

142
00:13:58,240 --> 00:14:00,900
I am willing to be
Gao Yuhai's mistress forever.

143
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,320
Kowtow.

144
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,360
Get up.

145
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:33,920
Get on the bed.

146
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:58,960
Strip.

147
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,840
Leave nothing on.

148
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,120
You are the lead actress
of this dance drama,

149
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,360
and also its investor.

150
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,320
Without you,

151
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,460
this dance drama wouldn't exist.

152
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:21,280
And there wouldn't be this memorable...

153
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:22,400
great moment.

154
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:26,960
It was also her who won
the dance competition

155
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,480
and the prize money,

156
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:31,690
which made the release
of this dance drama possible.

157
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,600
Here, I want to say...

158
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,960
Shen Xi,

159
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,920
marry me.

160
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:53,000
Okay.

161
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:56,320
I'll strip.

